***conformance tests***

# meta-today-and-defaults
`GET /api/meta` answers 200 with `today` "2026-11-21", `syntheticData` true, `defaultPatientId` "p3", `modelVersion` "standin-0.1", one clinician with id "c1", and `outcomes` with the six :Outcome: ids.

# two-pathways
`GET /api/pathways` answers 200 with the codes "stroke" and "ctr", each with one game of type "trace" and levels [1, 2, 3], and the questions "wellbeing" and "pain".
